# VocabLab — link list for YOUR Google Sheet
#
# Copy this file to my-sheet.txt and replace the link and the tab names below.
# `node tests/browser-smoke.mjs --live` loads exactly that file, and you can
# also copy EVERYTHING below into:
#   Settings ⚙ → Google Sheet → "⭐ Sheet link — no key" → the box → "Load sheet"
#
# The names after the link are your tabs (one topic each). Keeping them listed
# makes loading work even if your browser blocks Google requests (e.g. when
# index.html is opened by double-clicking). When you add / rename / remove a tab,
# just edit the list here (or press ↻ Reload after adding it).
#
# TIP: if you serve the app over http://localhost:8080 instead of double-clicking
# index.html, you can delete all the tab-name lines below and keep only the sheet
# link — VocabLab then detects every tab (including brand-new ones) by itself.
# On a double-clicked file:// page it asks the public r.jina.ai reader for the
# same list, so the link alone usually works there too.

https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/YOUR_SHEET_ID/edit?usp=sharing

Travel
Work
Food
